## Proposed Changes

### Supabase Service — New Fetch Methods

#### [MODIFY] [supabase_service.dart](file:///d:/Dept/PinkSlipReport-main/lib/core/services/supabase_service.dart)

Add new methods:
- `fetchAttendanceForDate(DateTime date)` → queries `daily_attendance` joined with `students` to get `roll_number`, `section_id`, `is_present`, `in_time`, `out_time` for a specific date
- `fetchLeaveSlipsWithStudentNames()` → queries `leave_slips` joined with `students` to resolve student names and roll numbers instead of just `student_id`
- `insertLeaveSlipAndMarkAbsent(...)` → inserts a new `leave_slips` record AND upserts `daily_attendance` with `is_present = false` in a single operation (pink slip → auto-absent)

